OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 3 JUN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto has another hour of the
OL,12,     Gbest in jazz from the UK and
OL,13,     Garound the world.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GMariam Batsashvili's recital
OL,16,     Gshows the breadth of her artistic
OL,17,     Gexpression: the haunting music of
OL,18,     GBach's Third Concerto and
OL,19,     GChopin's Andante spianato to
OL,20,     GHaydn's joyful Sonata in D.
